; `normalize [3 4]` is 0.6000000000000001, not 0.6: the division by the
; computed hypotenuse rounds up in the last place. That is exactly the
; kind of digit this corpus exists to hold identical between the native
; build and both WASM artifacts.
(diagnostics)
(values
  (value :index 0 :result [1 1])
  (value :index 1 :result [1 7])
  (value :index 2 :result [0.6000000000000001 0.8])
  (value :index 3 :result 5)
  (value :index 4 :result 5)
  (value :index 5 :result 32)
  (value :index 6 :result [0 0 1]))
